# A walnut reading table with a green leather inlay and an open book. Three
# tiles wide. The reader sits on the tile north of the middle one, facing the
# viewer, and the table top paints over their lap. Put the banker's lamp on
# the right tile.
sprite library-table
size 48 24
layer object
footprint 3 1
origin 0 8
tag table read library
spot read 1 -1 down read sit
variant oak w=o W=O 3=1

frame default
